[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.79, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "在那儿放个箱子，我这就去旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4324.99, "timestamp": "01:12:04", "text": "沿着这条路去收集宝箱，或者去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4327.669, "timestamp": "01:12:07", "text": "如果你在那个地方，我只能做到这样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4330.31, "timestamp": "01:12:10", "text": "我想要的就是这些，我只能做到这些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4333.189, "timestamp": "01:12:13", "text": "这就是我能做的，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4337.27, "timestamp": "01:12:17", "text": "你知道的旅程 救赎之旅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4340.27, "timestamp": "01:12:20", "text": "方舟，或许上帝正在注视并赐予。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4343.59, "timestamp": "01:12:23", "text": "给我第二次机会，看看我能做到什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4352.229, "timestamp": "01:12:32", "text": "我知道我意识到即使是天上的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4354.31, "timestamp": "01:12:34", "text": "豆子和不朽豆可以制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4363.149, "timestamp": "01:12:43", "text": "东西，它就是这样的东西，它就是这样的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.149, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4372.35, "timestamp": "01:12:52", "text": "我本该面对的痛苦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.669, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "我善良的心性别"}]